  {
   "slug": "about",
   "title": "Our greenhouse",
   "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"gs-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group gs-section\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"gs-eyebrow\"} --><p class=\"gs-eyebrow\">About Fernwood</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} --><h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">A small greenhouse with a big soft spot for plants</h1><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>We started Fernwood in a borrowed polytunnel with forty pothos cuttings. Today we grow over two hundred varieties, still by hand.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"gs-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group gs-section\"><!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:columns --><div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:about}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:about}}\" alt=\"The greenhouse with benches of young plants\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:about}}\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What we believe</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>A plant should arrive healthy, potted in good soil and with honest advice about where it will be happy. That's it. We would rather sell you a snake plant that thrives in your hallway than a fern that sulks.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Everything we ship is grown or finished in our greenhouse, packed in paper and card, and covered by a 30-day promise.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"gs-section gs-bg-sand\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group gs-section gs-bg-sand\"><!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"gs-feature\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group gs-feature\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Grown slowly</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Eight weeks on our benches before any plant ships.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"gs-feature\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group gs-feature\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Plastic-free</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Paper wraps, card boxes and compostable fillers.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"gs-feature\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group gs-feature\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Here to help</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Send a photo of a sad leaf and we'll reply within a day.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"gs-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group gs-section\"><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Ready to go green?</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/shop/\">Visit the shop</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div><!-- /wp:group -->"
  },
  {
   "slug": "contact",
   "title": "Contact",
   "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"gs-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group gs-section\"><!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:columns --><div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"gs-eyebrow\"} --><p class=\"gs-eyebrow\">Say hello</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} --><h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Questions about a plant? Ask us.</h1><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>We answer within a working day, usually much faster. Photos of struggling leaves welcome.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:list {\"className\":\"gs-plain-list\"} --><ul class=\"wp-block-list gs-plain-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>14 Greenhouse Row, Riverside</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>hello@fernwood.example</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>+1 555 0142</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Opening hours</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Tuesday to Saturday, 10:00&ndash;18:00<br>Sunday, 11:00&ndash;16:00</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Delivery</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Orders placed before 1 pm ship the same day, Tuesday to Thursday, so plants never sit in a depot over the weekend.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:group -->"
  }
 ],
